<BaseLayout title="Computational Tools" description="Software and infrastructure for electronic-structure work." current="computational-tools">
  <h1>Computational Tools</h1>
  <p class="lede">Tools will be organized by software package, program, workflow framework, visualization tool, database, and auxiliary utility.</p>
  <p>Inputs, outputs, commands, and error checks must remain inside the context of the specific program they describe. A command that detects normal termination does not by itself establish observable convergence or scientific validity.</p>
</BaseLayout>
